{"id":"cbea1b33aeed1412","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-chain-union.md","title":"Union of a Chain of Structures","display":"df-chain-union — Union of a Chain of Structures","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-chain-union","aliases":["17-df-chain-union"],"display":"df-chain-union — Union of a Chain of Structures","label_origin":"local-catalog","source_section":"3.1","source_printed_pages":"140","source_djvu_pages":"156","source_reference":"Definition of chain union; Lemma 3.1.8","source_pages_print":[140],"source_pages_djvu":[156],"source_result":"Chain-union definition and Lemma 3.1.8","source_verification":"definition and characterization compared in supplied OCR; local extension to nonempty linear indices","depends_on":["[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","[[17-df-linear-order]]"],"local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-chain-union"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-chain-union</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-chain-union — Union of a Chain of Structures"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"140"},{"key":"source_djvu_pages","html":"156"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition of chain union; Lemma 3.1.8"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>140</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>156</span></div>"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Chain-union definition and Lemma 3.1.8"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"definition and characterization compared in supplied OCR; local extension to nonempty linear indices"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3f12d30db6793ecd\" href=\"?note=3f12d30db6793ecd\" title=\"17-df-linear-order\">17-df-linear-order</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"{&lt;}\\subseteq I\\times I\">\\({&lt;}\\subseteq I\\times I\\)</span> 是候选严格序。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的集合函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_i=F(i)\">\\(\\mathfrak A_i=F(i)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 是候选结构。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> 及载体投影见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq_L\">\\(\\subseteq_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}\">\\(\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3f12d30db6793ecd\" href=\"?note=3f12d30db6793ecd\" title=\"17-df-linear-order\">17-df-linear-order</a>；族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\">\\((\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}\\)</span> 采用该依赖链中的函数图编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{StructureChain}_L(I,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I})\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}(I,&lt;)\n\\land(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}:I\\to\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(i&lt;j\\to\\mathfrak A_i\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak A_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L(I,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},\\mathfrak B)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{StructureChain}_L(I,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I})\n\\land\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land|\\mathfrak B|=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{StructureChain}_L(I,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I})\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}(I,&lt;)\n\\land(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}:I\\to\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(i&lt;j\\to\\mathfrak A_i\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak A_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L(I,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},\\mathfrak B)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{StructureChain}_L(I,&lt;,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I})\n\\land\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land|\\mathfrak B|=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Chang–Keisler defines ordinal-indexed chain unions componentwise in §3.1, printed p. 140, DjVu page 156. Lemma 3.1.8 states the equivalent characterization by the union carrier and containing every chain member as a substructure. This local atom allows any nonempty linear index order; every finite tuple lies in a common stage, so the same construction and uniqueness proof apply.</p>\n<p>The constants are common to all stages. Every function graph and relation interpretation is the union of the corresponding stage interpretations. Finitary arities and linear ordering ensure that these interpretations cover all tuples and agree wherever both are defined. Thus a structure tuple is never identified with its set-theoretic union. These are defining predicates; the existence argument is separate from their definitions.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"3f12d30db6793ecd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-linear-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$I$ 是集合，${<}\\subseteq I\\times I$ 是候选严格序。\n$F$ 是定义域为 $I$ 的集合函数，$\\mathfrak A_i=F(i)$；$\\mathfrak B$ 是候选结构。\n$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 及载体投影见 [[17-df-structure]]；$\\subseteq_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]。\n$\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}$ 见 [[17-df-linear-order]]；族 $(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 采用该依赖链中的函数图编码。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$I$ 是集合，${<}\\subseteq I\\times I$ 是候选严格序。\n$F$ 是定义域为 $I$ 的集合函数，$\\mathfrak A_i=F(i)$；$\\mathfrak B$ 是候选结构。\n$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 及载体投影见 [[17-df-structure]]；$\\subseteq_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]。\n$\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}$ 见 [[17-df-linear-order]]；族 $(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 采用该依赖链中的函数图编码。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"3f12d30db6793ecd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$I$ 是集合，${<}\\subseteq I\\times I$ 是候选严格序。\n$F$ 是定义域为 $I$ 的集合函数，$\\mathfrak A_i=F(i)$；$\\mathfrak B$ 是候选结构。\n$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 及载体投影见 [[17-df-structure]]；$\\subseteq_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]。\n$\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}$ 见 [[17-df-linear-order]]；族 $(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 采用该依赖链中的函数图编码。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"{<}\\subseteq I\\times I","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A_i=F(i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\subseteq_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{StructureChain}_L(I,<,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I})\n\\leftrightarrow{}&I\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}(I,<)\n\\land(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}:I\\to\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(i<j\\to\\mathfrak A_i\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak A_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L(I,<,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I},\\mathfrak B)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{StructureChain}_L(I,<,(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I})\n\\land\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\\\\n&\\land|\\mathfrak B|=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\mathfrak A_i\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2822,"backlinks":[{"id":"ba56c3cb1dd7ec8d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ is the coherent structure-union predicate from [[17-df-chain-union]]."},{"id":"aa3ceab2a7aa2799","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L$ is from [[17-df-elementary-chain]], and $\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ is from [[17-df-chain-union]]."},{"id":"8a4d6bb923655efc","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L$ and $\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ are from [[17-df-elementary-chain]] and [[17-df-chain-union]]."},{"id":"105ca7a585f377f9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 是固定的一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$、$\\mathrm{Mod}(T)$ 与 $\\models$ 见 [[17-df-model]]；$\\subseteq_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]；$\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ 见 [[17-df-chain-union]]。\n量化的指标 $I$ 为集合，$<$ 为其二元关系，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为定义域恰为 $I$ 的结构族；$\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ 已要求非空线序及相容子结构链。以下引入二个以理论为参数的元语言谓词。"},{"id":"288977f8607c0661","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ is from [[17-df-chain-union]]."},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-chain-union]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44"